<title>USA: Petrolite Corp Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Petrolite Corp Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.54     loss	 $0.60</p>
<p> Net    profit	    6,107     loss	 6,835</p>
<p> Revs			95,807		   91,332</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,342		   11,333</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $1.68   profit	  0.55</p>
<p> Net    profit	   19,031   profit	 6,230</p>
<p> Revs		     360,703		  364,877</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,338		   11,330</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 figures include a $9 million after-tax write-down of assets; without the charge, year-ago Q4 would have been $2.1 million or $0.19 per share.</p>
<p>1996 12 months included a $1.1 million or $0.10 per share benefit from the previously announced write-down of the company's Venezuelan operation in the second quarter.</p>
</text>
